+findings:
+  - id: ESD-01-DF-01
+    found_by: "ESD-01"
+    found_at_commit: "9635bad239986a4e5e07745947273bc4480a82a2"
+    schedule_revision: 1
+    severity: minor
+    blocking: false
+    surface:
+      production: []
+      tla: []
+      adapters: []
+      test_graph: []
+      workflow: ["specs/.history/*/*/manifest.json (writer: spec-double-2 close path)"]
+    summary: >-
+      No record in any of the six audited repositories timestamps the START of ticket work.
+      Close-history manifests carry only `created_at_utc`, which is the close time. PRs are opened
+      after the work. The median PR open-to-merge time is 0.02-0.14 h. So implementation active
+      time is unknown everywhere, and GOAL-ESD-VELOCITY's "cost component share" cannot be
+      reconstructed retrospectively for implementation.
+    reproduction: >-
+      Read any specs/.history/*/*/manifest.json in this repo or in commit-diff-context-parent,
+      meta-harness, polymarket, effectful-learning or skill-manager. Each has `created_at_utc` and
+      no opened/dispatched/started field. Batched closes make close-to-close spacing meaningless:
+      attribute-the-catch closed 5 tickets in 48 s.
+    evidence:
+      - "specs/results/evidence-sized-delivery/ESD-01/cost.md (sections 0 and 4)"
+    why_out_of_scope: >-
+      ESD-01 is evidence-only. Its conflict keys cover only its evidence root, and the user
+      mandate forbids new machinery.
+    suggested_fix: >-
+      For ESD-06 / the owner: record a start time per ticket in prose where the work already
+      writes. The assignment's dispatch comment and the PR body are two such places. Or read agent
+      session transcripts for the ESD-06 pilot. Either supplies the missing denominator without a
+      new tool.
+    blast_radius: "Measurement only; no behaviour change."
+    disposition: pending
+    disposition_ticket: null
+
+  - id: ESD-01-DF-02
+    found_by: "ESD-01"
+    found_at_commit: "9635bad239986a4e5e07745947273bc4480a82a2"
+    schedule_revision: 1
+    severity: minor
+    blocking: false
+    surface:
