+      workflow: []
+    summary: >-
+      RP-07-DF-01 is still carried, and its general half recurred. The executor's message still
+      names only bare PIDs (Executors.kt:226), and `grep KotlinCompileDaemon
+      skills/test-graph/references/workflows.md` is empty at 9635bad2. In the bug-sweep, BS-07
+      again needed a hand `ps` sampler to identify the lingering process
+      (specs/results/bug-sweep/BS-07/probe-lingering-descendant-ps.txt). The same node errored 13
+      times across 7 tickets (BS-07-DF-05). This is recurrence evidence for a carried finding, not
+      a new defect.
