+      - "specs/results/bug-sweep/deferred-ledger.yaml:317-333"
+      - "specs/results/evidence-sized-delivery/ESD-01/failure-families.md (F1)"
+    why_out_of_scope: "test-graph skill and executor are outside ESD-01's conflict keys; runtime changes are out of this epic's scope."
+    suggested_fix: "As RP-07-DF-01: surviving-process command lines in the ProcessContractViolation message, plus daemon guidance in workflows.md. ESD-03 can cite F1 as a preflight review priority."
